{"speciesId":444,"names":{"fr":"Carmache","es":"Gabite","en":"Gabite","ja":"ガバイト"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"There is a long-held belief that medicine made from its scales will heal even incurable illnesses."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It habitually digs up and hoards gems in its nest. Its loot is constantly targeted by thieves."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It loves sparkly things. It seeks treasures in caves and hoards the loot in its nest."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"As it digs to expand its nest, it habitually digs up gems that it then hoards in its nest."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"As it digs to expand its nest, it habitually digs up gems that it then hoards in its nest."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Toujours à la recherche d’objets brillants, il arpente les grottes pour constituer son butin."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It loves sparkly things. It seeks treasures in caves and hoards the loot in its nest."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Toujours à la recherche d’objets brillants, il arpente les grottes pour constituer son butin."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It loves sparkly things. It seeks treasures in caves and hoards the loot in its nest."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It loves sparkly things. It seeks treasures in caves and hoards the loot in its nest."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It loves sparkly things. It seeks treasures in caves and hoards the loot in its nest."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Toujours à la recherche d’objets brillants, il arpente les grottes pour constituer son butin."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Le gustan las cosas brillantes. Busca tesoros en cuevas y se lleva el botín a su nido."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It loves sparkly things. It seeks treasures in caves and hoards the loot in its nest."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"光り輝く ものが 大好きで 洞窟の 中で 見つけた 宝を 自分の巣に ためこむ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Carmache accumule les pierres précieuses qu’il déterre quand il entreprend d’agrandir son nid."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Tiende a acumular las gemas en bruto que encuentra cuando agranda su guarida."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"As it digs to expand its nest, it habitually digs up gems that it then hoards in its nest."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"巣穴を 広げるとき 地中から 出てきた 宝石の 原石を 巣に ためる 習性を 持つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Toujours à la recherche d’objets brillants, il arpente les grottes pour constituer son butin."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Le gustan las cosas brillantes. Busca tesoros en cuevas y se lleva el botín a su nido."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It loves sparkly things. It seeks treasures in caves and hoards the loot in its nest."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"光り輝く ものが 大好きで 洞窟の 中で 見つけた 宝を 自分の巣に ためこむ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Carmache accumule les pierres précieuses qu’il déterre quand il entreprend d’agrandir son nid."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Tiende a acumular las gemas en bruto que encuentra cuando agranda su guarida."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"As it digs to expand its nest, it habitually digs up gems that it then hoards in its nest."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"巣穴を 広げるとき 地中から 出てきた 宝石の 原石を 巣に ためる 習性を 持つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il perd parfois ses écailles quand il mue. Les remèdes à base d’écailles de Carmache sont de puissants toniques."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Muy ocasionalmente puede mudar la piel y perder las escamas. Las medicinas que las usan como ingrediente son muy reconstituyentes."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"In rare cases, it molts and sheds its scales. Medicine containing its scales as an ingredient will make a weary body feel invigorated."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"稀に 脱皮し ウロコが 剥げる。 その成分が 含まれる 薬は 疲れた 体を ギンギンにする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il adore tout ce qui brille. Au fond de sa tanière, il contemple les joyaux qu’il a dérobés et les Strassie qu’il a kidnappés."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Le gustan las cosas brillantes. Pasa largas horas en su cueva, admirando las gemas y los Carbink que ha capturado."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Shiny objects are its passion. It can be found in its cave, scarcely moving, its gaze fixed on the jewels it’s amassed or Carbink it has caught."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"光り 輝くものが 大好き。 宝石や 捕まえた メレシーを 巣穴で じーっと 眺めている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il adore tout ce qui brille, et rien ne l’énerve plus qu’un Ténéfix s’en prenant à un Strassie. S’il est témoin d’une telle agression, il passe à l’attaque."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Se vuelve loco por las cosas brillantes y no duda en atacar con violencia a los Sableye que acechan a los Carbink."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It loves shiny things. When it finds a Sableye trying to catch a Carbink, Gabite becomes furiously angry and attacks the Sableye."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"光るものが 大好き。 メレシーを 狙う ヤミラミを 見つけると 激しく 怒って 襲いかかる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il mue régulièrement au cours de sa croissance. Les écailles ainsi tombées peuvent être pilées pour préparer des remèdes traditionnels."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Muda la piel a medida que crece. Las escamas que pierde se pueden pulverizar para utilizar como ingrediente en remedios medicinales."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It sheds its skin and gradually grows larger. Its scales can be ground into a powder and used as raw materials for traditional medicine."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"脱皮して 大きくなって いく。 ウロコを 擦って 粉にした ものは 漢方薬の 原料に なる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il émet des ultrasons avec les deux appendices sur sa tête pour sonder les grottes obscures."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Explora las más oscuras cuevas utilizando ondas ultrasónicas que emite desde las protuberancias a ambos lados de la cabeza."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"This Pokémon emits ultrasonic waves from a protrusion on either side of its head to probe pitch-dark caves."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"頭の 左右の 突起から 超音波を 出して 真っ暗な 洞穴の 様子を 調べるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il cache des pierres précieuses dans le sol de sa grotte, et accueille à coups de griffes et de crocs quiconque ose y pénétrer."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Entierra gemas en la cueva que le sirve de nido y hace trizas con sus garras y colmillos a cualquier intruso."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Jewels are buried in the caves these Pokémon nest in, but you’ll be torn apart by claws and fangs the moment you enter one of these caves."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"すみかの 洞窟には 宝石を 埋蔵するが 入りこんだとたんに ツメと キバで ズタズタにされる。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Though Gabite are usually of a violent disposition, when I gave one a glass bead it had been eyeing covetously, it suddenly became quite docile."}],"varieties":[{"id":444,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"sand-attack","learns":[[8,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",3],[9,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",3],[10,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",3],[11,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",3],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",3],[15,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",3],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",3],[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",3],[